Env required for the full 80-test baseline:
  DATABASE_URL=postgres://anchor:anchor@localhost:5434/anchor_dev
  TEST_DATABASE_URL=postgres://anchor:anchor@localhost:5434/anchor_test
  (Docker container: anchor-sites-postgres-1, host port 5434)

If TEST_DATABASE_URL is unset the integration tests skip cleanly and the
suite drops to ~47 passing (smoke + unit-only — email + routine-state +
block tests still run, since they don't need a DB). The routine should keep both env vars set.

Boot Postgres at the start of any run that touches the DB:
  docker compose up -d postgres

